ts on the stand row (engine y + 5, the cell over the feet), the damage rate spread over the clip length; conveyors are the carry tile runs at 5.5 px per tick and 32 ticks per s; teleports go from the pad centre to the target foot cell, enabledBy names the flag a conditioned pad needs; each variant is the cell patch from the base map to that map file (variantSources), blocking cells only, a whole-map state, not cumulative; enemies stand at their original foot cells",
